Fenwick successor/predecessor:
```
class Fenwick:
    def __init__(n): bit=[0]*(n+1); total=0
    def add(i,delta): i+=1; while...; total+=delta
    def sum(i): # inclusive, if i<0 return0
    def kth(k): # 1-indexed, assumes 1<=k<=total
        idx=0; bitmask=highest power<=n
        while bitmask:
            nxt=idx+bitmask
            if nxt<=n and bit[nxt]<k:
                idx=nxt; k-=bit[nxt]
            bitmask//=2
        return idx # zero-based rank because idx is largest with prefix<k, answer idx (0-based)
```
